markers tend to raise the prediction. Function words and verb/adverb endings
receive less. The opening of a document adds a decaying offset. This is a
coarse orthographic approximation, not a full syntactic parser. Byte fragments
and conversation-control markers receive separate defaults. No token-id table
is used; state is only the previous token and the position in this document.
